<tr>
<td><a href="img/yotsubatoshirokuro2_012.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/yotsubatoshirokuro2_012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/yotsubato2/img/yotsubatoshirokuro2_012.jpg" --></a><a href="img/yotsubatoshirokuro2_013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/yotsubatoshirokuro2_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/yotsubato2/img/yotsubatoshirokuro2_013.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">きちんと目も塗られています。<br />
模様にあわせて分割がされていておもしろい。<br />
